# The per-run mirror of scripts/ that the test harness needs: it resolves plugin folders against
# its OWN directory (vc.path_list_dir is app-local), while package.path resolves against the repo.
# Written fresh by tests/run_tests.py sync_scripts() on every run - generated, never edited.
tests/harness/build/scripts/
